Ah, have you made room for the\nSeviian Egg?

#org @gText_CeladonSeviiEgg_6
[.]Hmm, seems like you still don't\nhave room.\pI'll be here until you make space.\pSee you around!

#org @gText_CeladonSeviiEgg_7
[.]Great! Please, take it.

#org @gText_Celadon_Gambler1
[BLUE]Hah! A minor! Disappointed you\ncan't gamble? Lucky you, I've\lgot quite the proposition.\pSlots here just don't really\ndo it for me now.

#org @gText_Celadon_Gambler2
I love betting on Pok\emon\nBattles!\pIf you'd like, we can bet on a\nbattle with a team of Metronome\lonly Pok\emon.\pWhat do you say?

