Haha! Let's see who's side\nlady luck is on!

#org @gText_BetHowMuch
How much would you like to\nbet?

#org @gText_Gamble_NotEnough
Woah! Don't gamble more than you have,\nkid!\pYou're something else!

#org @gText_Celadon_YouLost
Well, I'll be keeping your money!\pAlthough you're probably going\nto reset to your last save\llike a little cheater, so this\lbasically never happened.

#org @gText_Celadon_YouWin
Agh, you got me you got me!\p[SHRINK][.] lucky bastard[.]

