#org @gText_Celadon_LucarioMan1 
This is my trusted pal, [GREEN]Lucario.\p[BLUE]I got it from the Game Corner\nas a [GREEN]Riolu [BLUE]when I was little.\pAfter growing together through\ntough times, he evolved.

