#org @gText_giovanni1_Giovannitxt1
So! I must say, I am impressed you\ngot here.\pTeam Rocket captures Pok\emon from\naround the world.\pThey're important tools for keeping\nour criminal enterprise going.\pI am the leader, [GREEN]Giovanni![BLUE]\pFor your insolence, you will feel a\nworld of pain!

#org @gText_giovanni1_Giovanniloss
What!\nThis can't be!

#org @gText_giovanni1_Giovannitxt2
I see that you raise Pok\emon with\nutmost care.\pA child like you would never\nunderstand what I hope to achieve.\pI shall step aside this time!\pI hope we meet again[.]

