Physical Sweeper

#org @gText_Special_Lucario
Special Sweeper

#org @gText_gText_Mixed_Lucario
Mixed Attacker

#org @gText_Lucario_PickedPhysical
Mmm[.] Physical sweeping Lucario\nis excellent with Swords Dance and a\lstrong 120 Base Power Move in\lClose Combat.\pA fine choice.

#org @gText_Lucario_PickedSpecial
Mmm[.] Special sweeping Lucario\nis great with Nasty Plot and\lis an effective use of its iconic\lmove, Aura Sphere. A decent choice.

#org @gText_Lucario_PickedMixed
Mmm[.] Mixed attacking Lucario\nis useful for hitting the\lenemy at its weakest point.\pNot my preference, but I can\nget behind it.

#org @gText_Lucario_Flaws
With that being said,\nbase [GREEN]Lucario [BLUE]has its flaws.

#org @gText_Lucario_Flaws2
What would you say its biggest\nflaw is?

#org @gText_PowerCreep
Power Creep

#org @gText_4MSS
4 Move Slot Syndrome

#org @gText_SpeedTier
Bad Speed Tier

#org @gText_Lucario_PickedPowerCreep
Yes[.] with the power levels\nrising each Generation Lucario\lfound itself outclassed[.]

#org @gText_Lucario_4mss
Yes[.] [GREEN]Lucario[BLUE] sometimes struggles\nto get what it wants with 4\lmove slots[.]

#org @gText_Lucario_SpeedTier
Mm[.] even with its strong priority\nmoves, a 90 Base Speed isn't the\lmost desirable for a sweeper.

#org @gText_Lucario_DoYouThink
Tell me then, do you think\n[GREEN]Mega Lucario[BLUE] is busted?

#org @gText_Lucario_NeverMind
Oh, never mind then[.]

#org @gText_Lucario_Yeppers
